# "Sacrifice this creature: Remove all counters from target permanent." Paradise Mantle, with the hone counter Dwalin's entering
# put on it, is equipped to Dwalin (3/1, CR 122.1j). Bot2 sacrifices Vampire Hexmage targeting the Mantle: the counter comes off
# and Dwalin's power changes at once (the ruling), back to 2/1, with the Mantle still attached.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mountain
Paradise Mantle
Dwalin, Weaponmaster
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Vampire Hexmage
Swamp x17

